/guid><pubDate>Mon, 05 May 2025 07:04:01 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>🖼 RSSFilter.com: RSS 内容过滤工具</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="http://rssfilter.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;&lt;b&gt;RSSFilter.com&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;b&gt;: RSS 内容过滤工具&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;该工具 &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1513?q=%23%E5%BC%80%E6%BA%90"&gt;#开源&lt;/a&gt; 可自架，实现内容 &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1513?q=%23%E8%BF%87%E6%BB%A4"&gt;#过滤&lt;/a&gt; 功能：&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="emoji"&gt;🔗&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="https://rssfilter.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://rssfilter.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="emoji"&gt;🐙&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/loopwerk/django-rss-filter" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://github.com/loopwerk/django-rss-filter&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;作者写的介绍日志：&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.loopwerk.io/articles/2025/announcing-rssfilter-com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://www.loopwerk.io/articles/2025/announcing-rssfilter-com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;发现于作者嘟文：&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://hachyderm.io/@kevinrenskers/114308702275578978" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://hachyderm.io/@kevinrenskers/114308702275578978&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;其它类似工具有 &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1405" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;RSS-lambda&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1279" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;Feed Filter Maker&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/223" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;siftRSS&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/716" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;Grepfeed&lt;/a&gt; 等&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/JKSeDFYo7sBoBbsU9q5HKzrWbUpotWLZM-jV_lfLSoApZk2Olu7VoM2XRLgzs8M2rB8AL9LPg50juG5ub4B_LtCotu3YaD45EKIzWILDelV5jaNGSe7hsp5aOS1TMlSiRsghuOkPnrTi0eUa2BVJ3gVHOUPy-jqRQsHJ5o-SH0IE24ou5yv_OITbXJcXyXMuTBI32Py7_mBxuavPPZ4rgDGzascMvCGxgXGLhTlrjwYc7Pob5UZ06Dg6ApB__joElt8CmAZ_rtPvNK3GmDyaqZ2x7vMzbIUZrqtq58EuoUT8ODdRGTQ2Ue4_nF6bkYpRkU2Boyf4NMuScDt-ASZBMg.jpg" width="800" height="252" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/aboutrss/1513</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/aboutrss/1513</guid><pubDate>Thu, 17 Apr 2025 00:59:04 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>🖼 GitHub Repo 「ALL-about-RSS」 五年了</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;GitHub Repo 「ALL-about-RSS」 五年了&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;五年前的今天，我提交了「&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/536" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;ALL-about-RSS&lt;/a&gt;」的第一条 &lt;a href="https://github.com/AboutRSS/ALL-about-RSS/commit/fbb01c3fa2279df9048f23d6cd52e7b04b9daa1c" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;commit&lt;/a&gt;，以彰显 RSS 作为开放规范的多样性和生命力。五年后，该 List 承蒙大家托举，成长为了一个 RSS 玩家的乐土，有开发者来 PR 自己的 RSS 相关作品，有爱好者来纠错补缺，也有&lt;a href="https://rss.tips/#donators" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;捐赠&lt;/a&gt;、加星、关注等各种形式的支持与助力。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://star-history.com/#aboutrss/all-about-rss&amp;amp;Date" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;5K+ &lt;span class="emoji"&gt;⭐️&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/AboutRSS/ALL-about-RSS/forks" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;200+ forks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/aboutrss/all-about-rss/graphs/contributors" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;40+ 位贡献者&lt;/a&gt;，已使 &lt;a href="https://github.com/AboutRSS/ALL-about-RSS/pulls" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;PR 序号来到 #100&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;感谢各位 RSS 玩家，也欢迎继续群策群力。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/IBzGu2NtRRaLMTB-gI_Ce8o4nzpVIk1DFleQcW1PFHQh1AwW5tOCJXpIIVSq2on3Vrj9Rrbsq8dj5Zjs3rrh7Vm_Y2HNegeI2JwohN1eEMg4WTsPX9PirrObXaD16X1D4DO3z3a8utovr40DNeH4PaiCAEOq8nRyzKwB1ORVhafZevlBlQkMWRodur4EZnir-YEFpA7Yg2M7NWvOlAq1KmbeT4UpPEcs98_hY_GLoO-Dvj-4vaBvVNH8IwxSLfZfBTfwL0wGL930Yrm5nj5QcrXUuIm4zSwqqAtE98Ml5A6CoIYTZAVKpRSsb-hqVsGDj_GI4b9nI3yEpttd91E8Cw.jpg" width="800" height="460" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/aboutrss/1512</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/aboutrss/1512</guid><pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 01:01:16 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>🖼 Fread: 一个支持 RSS 订阅的 Mastodon/Bluesky 客户端</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fread: 一个支持 RSS 订阅的 Mastodon/Bluesky 客户端&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;该 &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1511?q=%23Android"&gt;#Android&lt;/a&gt; App 免费，主打长毛象客户端，但也支持订阅 RSS 和 Bluesky，意味着可以构建多渠道的混合 Feed 流。上线于 24 年夏天。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;官网：&lt;a href="https://fread.xyz/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://fread.xyz/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;作者自荐：&lt;a href="https://medium.com/@kezhang404/fread-the-next-generation-mastodon-client-30bc50e279fd" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://medium.com/@kezhang404/fread-the-next-generation-mastodon-client-30bc50e279fd&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;发现于作者推文：&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://x.com/zhangke19/status/1909825627504755112" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://x.com/zhangke19/status/1909825627504755112&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/N_F-bi4hx-iGMDhUelmgb31EtCwapvxDlus46MeT6_4fsQlYRiJWI62AmZ7AoFkl-Ti3O_7FMXxfFoMlAmoJPSuzAjIzWW1yo6km8vzV-h-KqpCF8PGPNjqCuBZTPjS-1Odi-PrsIEAd3kM0H2rS2i1ofjK4ibhbH0_4DVSPn_lfox46xFyWuxj258OcQZgtRCg5OaZ5FYk1Uty9KaYsxxHqP6CfxlDdgaNTj1wJXhgB8DnXpRMfvPZwle2mLFshHxGCo6lcXOlJQwlv2qH_F9T9HLUL2uw2yILtQngGtH2i-kdNjKEpY7AT8J-oXEI7lmi_pfxgkYmZ_A9hlpWnPw.jpg" width="800" height="285" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/aboutrss/1511</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/aboutrss/1511</guid><pubDate>Wed, 09 Apr 2025 12:02:50 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>🖼 MastoLink2RSS : 一个将 #Mastodon 时间线中的 url 抽取出来制成 RSS feed 的 工具</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;MastoLink2RSS : 一个将 &lt;/b&gt;&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1510?q=%23Mastodon"&gt;&lt;b&gt;#Mastodon&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;b&gt; 时间线中的 url 抽取出来制成 RSS feed 的 工具&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;频道提及过数个为社交媒体时间线中的链接创建 RSS Feed 的工具（&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/377" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/628" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;2&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1080" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;3&lt;/a&gt;），都没活下来。Twitter/X 的那些可能是因为受限于封闭平台，希望 Fediverse 且 &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1510?q=%23%E5%BC%80%E6%BA%90"&gt;#开源&lt;/a&gt; 的这个能长久存活：&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://masto2rss.gedanken.uber.space/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://masto2rss.gedanken.uber.space/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;发现于&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://scholar.social/@gedankenstuecke/113322700501308956" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://scholar.social/@gedankenstuecke/113322700501308956&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/U3nKaV1VJhWeQCM9Vqcx1I39X5mm7TxdCo_-FgPz6s5I8I0cWkCq8ZBuYxBzDJGyl_5jqw0OVqrQNOwHFHrIsm5em6_OPacAVbbNQTeRC9P72a-wSQWDvFAYsncqllfOfS1TljzVVwNVJ5ME484_69X2BizpUStE6ty0LAw-NjIyyxrDzwVKmRlKSrTHZrMPn2mxXRmdt7nDminZAFxxanK8BOzVrWIHb6TIpyonV5VFx_yx_N4D45VwSX_wk3Hwi88vMKbRCqg4gvrLXEc46AMKmiBHcd2OQsKi7mwxVKPlQuxRS-aWolhTzEkP2VJyqN9rsdQ8wQs--DtphoLvUg.jpg" width="552" height="239" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/aboutrss/1510</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/aboutrss/1510</guid><pubDate>Mon, 07 Apr 2025 12:02:52 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>🖼 与 RSS 有关的 #bookmarking 工具信息四则</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;与 RSS 有关的 &lt;/b&gt;&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1509?q=%23bookmarking"&gt;&lt;b&gt;#bookmarking&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;b&gt; 工具信息四则&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="emoji"&gt;🔸&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1509?q=%23%E5%BC%80%E6%BA%90"&gt;#开源&lt;/a&gt; 可自架 网摘管理器/稍后读工具 &lt;b&gt;Linkwarden&lt;/b&gt; v2.9 支持 &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1509?q=%23RSS2bookmark"&gt;#RSS2bookmark&lt;/a&gt; 以及为公开收录输出 RSS Feed&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://blog.linkwarden.app/releases/2.9" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://blog.linkwarden.app/releases/2.9&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="emoji"&gt;🔸&lt;/span&gt; 开源 可自架 网摘管理器/稍后读工具 &lt;b&gt;Hoarder&lt;/b&gt; v0.19 支持 RSS2bookmark&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/hoarder-app/hoarder/discussions/632" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://github.com/hoarder-app/hoarder/discussions/632&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="emoji"&gt;🔸&lt;/span&gt;Pocket RSS: 一个因为 &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1509?q=%23Pocket"&gt;#Pocket&lt;/a&gt; 停止为公开收录生成 RSS 而诞生的服务&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://pocket-rss.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://pocket-rss.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="emoji"&gt;🔸&lt;/span&gt;Linkboard: 免费版支持订阅 5 个 RSS 以供 RSS2bookmark&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://linkboard.leonifrancesco.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://linkboard.leonifrancesco.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;同类可与 RSS 互动的 收藏夹 工具还有 &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1509?q=%23Wallabag"&gt;#Wallabag&lt;/a&gt; 、 &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1509?q=%23Pinboard"&gt;#Pinboard&lt;/a&gt;、 Raindrop 等。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/bfqUa9HKHZvmLZfQ6BhL3jGvw8TuO17ZaQtlT6PfMn5qqqLXJcMyPis9RUtjFBnVSITRZ4LiId25M-TRfxV4z-eH1gggbYKhwYSU6iuF3H_We7bf5-_eb2iUMAqeSDWTBYP80Wpn3BRm3L5d7LpBruXuiE4kcWXz6orxgZBtqswdjeQZl0Ft8sg_8zM3FTGH9jt_GICWH_tbYIkov4OtMIgIqNQXgxhRZbL67NX4j0XFXuASDgjWOQJmxIX4--GUfQu88h0JVOtDHaUAjBx2AZDAoXD1XKSxNyXNP_TPCq8FG0l7kbGbH3Cb8hlMGQIZeslglWbHLV_FSVZTqoNl4w.jpg" width="800" height="444" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/aboutrss/1509</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/aboutrss/1509</guid><pubDate>Sat, 05 Apr 2025 09:34:46 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>🖼 RSSFlow Reader: 一款有 AI 加持的浏览器扩展版 RSS 阅读器</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;RSSFlow Reader: 一款有 AI 加持的浏览器扩展版 RSS 阅读器&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;RSSFlow Reader 是一个 &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1508?q=%23%E6%B5%8F%E8%A7%88%E5%99%A8%E6%89%A9%E5%B1%95"&gt;#浏览器扩展&lt;/a&gt;，主打基于 &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1508?q=%23AI"&gt;#AI&lt;/a&gt; 和多种版式的阅读体验提升：&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;官网主页：&lt;a href="https://oinzen.github.io/RSSFlow-doc/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://oinzen.github.io/RSSFlow-doc/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;用户交流群：&lt;a href="https://t.me/+fTK4yn1n3aU5YWFl" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://t.me/+fTK4yn1n3aU5YWFl&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;发现于作者推文：&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://x.com/rssflow_zen/status/1881900652827419006" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://x.com/rssflow_zen/status/1881900652827419006&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/VrWvQjc-9xzzr13iLT87AKKx8tTZ_pUJwOoi9ZTCy8aWteZfNQHQbASPHU0DpIpHXFYn3vZpjRIm5iQ9JlOG6kwikLctOMIgk9xbCTl-B4fH_-qOGl35W9V5D8RvBgEMpMsON-YhYjfMmZq-iTsKlJGxBg6sDf77HskSuNXad1DDdpzE2Y0ZlUYbubJ9WiQwbQcjVrj6drlmNRjLL0teSkPyZVpA0LiRCDVS_mxti8aA43I_braeUM5MM3qemaJ0jbpKk_u5gU8F1tv5xEUhQqJ5Z6k2-wxfd7vL8SFpAkcMNwb9rf1_Gxp1FhENjwl6PmD_FZ-wPm-VtX18SFOzzA.jpg" width="800" height="569" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/aboutrss/1508</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/aboutrss/1508</guid><pubDate>Thu, 03 Apr 2025 13:51:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>🖼 RSS #玩家 #心得 #教程 #观点 分享：第 69 期</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;RSS &lt;/b&gt;&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1507?q=%23%E7%8E%A9%E5%AE%B6"&gt;&lt;b&gt;#玩家&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;b&gt; &lt;/b&gt;&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1507?q=%23%E5%BF%83%E5%BE%97"&gt;&lt;b&gt;#心得&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;b&gt; &lt;/b&gt;&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1507?q=%23%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B"&gt;&lt;b&gt;#教程&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;b&gt; &lt;/b&gt;&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1507?q=%23%E8%A7%82%E7%82%B9"&gt;&lt;b&gt;#观点&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;b&gt; 分享：第 69 期&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span class="emoji"&gt;1️⃣&lt;/span&gt;「&lt;a href="https://dev.to/justlig/rss-a-great-standard-that-cant-keep-up-4ibp" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;RSS: A Great Standard That Can’t Keep Up&lt;/a&gt;」&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="emoji"&gt;2️⃣&lt;/span&gt;「&lt;a href="https://www.johnwalker.nl/posts/escape-the-walled-garden-with-rss" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;Escape the walled garden and algorithm black boxes with RSS feeds&lt;/a&gt;」 &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="emoji"&gt;3️⃣&lt;/span&gt;「&lt;a href="https://reedybear.bearblog.dev/what-good-feed-reader-rss-support-looks-like-on-a-website/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;What good feed reader (RSS) support looks like on a website&lt;/a&gt;」 &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="emoji"&gt;4️⃣&lt;/span&gt;「&lt;a href="https://amxmln.com/blog/2025/spicing-up-your-feeeeds/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;Spicing up your feeeeds&lt;/a&gt;」&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="emoji"&gt;5️⃣&lt;/span&gt;「&lt;a href="https://blog.mochi.is/p/trigger-actions-on-new-feed-items" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;Trigger actions on new feed items with IFTTT and Feed Control&lt;/a&gt;」&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="emoji"&gt;6️⃣&lt;/span&gt;「&lt;a href="https://rubenerd.com/using-rss-over-json-feeds/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;Using RSS over JSON Feeds?&lt;/a&gt;」&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="emoji"&gt;7️⃣&lt;/span&gt;「&lt;a href="https://openrss.org/blog/using-cloudflare-on-your-website-could-be-blocking-rss-users" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;Using Cloudflare on your website could be blocking RSS users&lt;/a&gt;」&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="emoji"&gt;8️⃣&lt;/span&gt;「&lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-5MtaffecZU" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;Switch to RSS for your online media!&lt;/a&gt;」 &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1507?q=%23YouTube"&gt;#YouTube&lt;/a&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="emoji"&gt;9️⃣&lt;/span&gt;「&lt;a href="https://hobbies.deimos-legion.net/2025/01/21/rediscovering-rss/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;Rediscovering RSS&lt;/a&gt;」&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="emoji"&gt;🔟&lt;/span&gt;「The Anatomy of an RSS Reader」 Part &lt;a href="https://primatology.xyz/blog/the-anatomy-of-an-rss-reader-part-1" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://primatology.xyz/blog/the-anatomy-of-an-rss-reader-part-2" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;2&lt;/a&gt; &amp;amp; &lt;a href="https://primatology.xyz/blog/the-anatomy-of-an-rss-reader-part-3" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;上一期：【&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1496" target="_blank" rel="noopener